          "archive_note": "Wayback availability 2026-10-28 fant et øyeblikksbilde."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://oehha.ca.gov/sites/default/files/media/downloads/calenviroscreen/report/calenviroscreen40reportf2021.pdf",
